=== interpretation ===
  To explain away HR 2.28 entirely, an unmeasured mechanism would need to be
  associated with BOTH IIH status AND seizure ascertainment by >= 3.99-fold each,
  conditional on the measured covariates. Marginal association at that magnitude is
  NOT sufficient -- the E-value is a threshold on the conditional associations.
  To move the CI to include 1 requires >= 2.62-fold on both.

  NOTE: ED contact RR (5.74) exceeds the point-estimate threshold. This is a caveat,
  not a reassurance: ED contact is a plausible ascertainment channel for seizures and
  its magnitude is compatible with a substantial detection contribution.

